cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ROTA in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ROTA: Rotational Order Tracking and Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Zhenxian
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZhenxianLi/ROTA"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  ROTA is a lightweight Python library for order analysis of noise and
  vibration signals from rotating machinery, with tools for order-based sound
  resynthesis. It depends only on NumPy and SciPy, implements each function
  from the published literature, and validates it against synthetic signals
  with analytic ground truth.
keywords:
  - order tracking
  - order analysis
  - computed order tracking
  - NVH
  - acoustics
  - vibration
  - rotating machinery
